aw  policy or procedure  according to transparent nevada which  collects salary information for public  employees  scott was a dps officer with total pay  and benefits  of close to 97 thousand dollars  i reached out to metro to find out more  about the investigation and i received  this document citing law enforcement  privilege  open active criminal investigation  basically saying this information needs  to be confidential for now denise back  to you
 

